12	/**
13	 * Creates a fresh in-memory SQLite database with all tables for testing.
14	 * Each call returns a new isolated database instance.
15	 *
16	 * Uses the same Drizzle migrations as the live database, ensuring
17	 * test and production schemas are always in sync.
